{"title": "Spell flags", "pageid": 50343, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Spell_flags", "categories": ["Spell flags", "Modding resources"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Spell flags</b> are technical properties of abilities. Despite the name, they are not specific to <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">spells</a> and are used for all actions in Baldur's Gate 3. Some of these properties are reflected in in-game tooltips such as <code>IsConcentration</code>, but others like <code>HasHighGroundRangeExtension</code> are hidden, but nevertheless useful to know.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Spell flag\n</th>\n<th>Meaning\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>AbortOnSecondarySpellRollFail</code>\n</th>\n<td>This is used exclusively for actions that can throw another target like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/25px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/38px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/50px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/25px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">Throw</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Telekinesis\" title=\"Telekinesis\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp/25px-Telekinesis_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp/38px-Telekinesis_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp/50px-Telekinesis_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Telekinesis\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp/25px-Telekinesis_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Telekinesis\" title=\"Telekinesis\">Telekinesis</a>. It determines if the action continues after failing the <code>ThrowableSpellRoll</code> which is usually a <a href=\"/wiki/Contests\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Contests\">contested</a> Athletics check. Most throw-like actions have this flag, but some do not such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Enraged_Throw\" title=\"Enraged Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Enraged_Throw_Icon.webp/25px-Enraged_Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Enraged_Throw_Icon.webp/38px-Enraged_Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Enraged_Throw_Icon.webp/50px-Enraged_Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Enraged Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Enraged_Throw_Icon.webp/25px-Enraged_Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Enraged_Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Enraged_Throw\" title=\"Enraged Throw\">Enraged Throw</a>. Without this flag, creatures cannot avoid being thrown even after winning the contested skill check.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>AbortOnSpellRollFail</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>AddFallDamageOnLand</code>\n</th>\n<td>For actions that push or move, the target suffers <a href=\"/wiki/Falling_damage\" title=\"Falling damage\">falling damage</a> if applicable.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>AllowMoveAndCast</code>\n</th>\n<td>Using this action does not interrupt queued movement. This is only used by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hide\" title=\"Hide\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Hide_Icon.webp/25px-Hide_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Hide_Icon.webp/38px-Hide_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Hide_Icon.webp/50px-Hide_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hide\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Hide_Icon.webp/25px-Hide_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Hide_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hide\" title=\"Hide\">Hide</a> and related actions and allows players to hide while moving.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>CallAlliesSpell</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>CanAreaDamageEvade</code>\n</th>\n<td>Actions which deal area damage that can be affected by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Evasion\" title=\"Evasion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Evasion_Icon.webp/25px-Evasion_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Evasion_Icon.webp/38px-Evasion_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Evasion_Icon.webp/50px-Evasion_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Evasion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Evasion_Icon.webp/25px-Evasion_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7c/Evasion_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Evasion\" title=\"Evasion\">Evasion</a>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>CanDualWield</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>CannotRotate</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>CannotTargetCharacter</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>CannotTargetItems</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>CannotTargetTerrain</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>ChasmRecovery</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>CombatLogSetSingleLineRoll</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>DisableBlood</code>\n</th>\n<td>Action does not create a blood splatter when dealing damage. This does not affect the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blood_(surface)\" title=\"Blood (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Blood_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Blood_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Blood_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Blood_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Blood_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Blood_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blood\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Blood_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Blood_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/34/Blood_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blood_(surface)\" title=\"Blood (surface)\">Blood</a> surface that is spawned, only the particle effects on impact.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>DisplayDamageModifiers</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>DisplayInItemTooltip</code>\n</th>\n<td>For actions attached to consumable items, show this action in the item tooltip.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>DontAbortPerforming</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>HasHighGroundRangeExtension</code>\n</th>\n<td>Action receives increased range when targeting enemies at a lower elevation. See <a href=\"/wiki/High_ground_rules\" title=\"High ground rules\">High ground rules</a> for details.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>HasSomaticComponent</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>HasVerbalComponent</code>\n</th>\n<td>Action requires a verbal component that can be suppressed by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Silenced_(Condition)\" title=\"Silenced (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Silenced\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Silenced_(Condition)\" title=\"Silenced (Condition)\">Silenced</a>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>HideInItemTooltip</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>IgnoreAoO</code>\n</th>\n<td>For movement actions that do not provoke <a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\">attacks of opportunity</a>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>IgnorePreviouslyPickedEntities</code>\n</th>\n<td>For actions that can select multiple targets, this means that a single target cannot be selected multiple times.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>IgnoreSilence</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>IgnoreVisionBlock</code>\n</th>\n<td>Action can target a creature or point obscured by magical <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Darkness_(cloud)\" title=\"Darkness (cloud)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp/25px-Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp/38px-Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp/50px-Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Darkness\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp/25px-Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Darkness_(cloud)\" title=\"Darkness (cloud)\">Darkness</a> or a similar effect.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>ImmediateCast</code>\n</th>\n<td>Action is performed immediately when used rather than entering a targeting or confirmation interface.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>InventorySelection</code>\n</th>\n<td>Action opens an inventory selection menu. This is exclusively used for <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/25px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/38px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/50px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/25px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">Throw</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Telekinesis\" title=\"Telekinesis\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp/25px-Telekinesis_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp/38px-Telekinesis_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp/50px-Telekinesis_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Telekinesis\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp/25px-Telekinesis_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Telekinesis\" title=\"Telekinesis\">Telekinesis</a>, and similar actions.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>Invisible</code>\n</th>\n<td>Action can be performed without breaking <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(Condition)\" title=\"Invisible (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Invisibility\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(Condition)\" title=\"Invisible (Condition)\">Invisibility</a> or triggering a stealth check with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Greater_Invisibility_(Condition)\" title=\"Greater Invisibility (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Greater_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Greater_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Greater_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Greater_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Greater_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Greater_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Greater Invisibility\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Greater_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Greater_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/86/Greater_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Greater_Invisibility_(Condition)\" title=\"Greater Invisibility (Condition)\">Greater Invisibility</a>. See also <code>Stealth</code>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>IsAttack</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>IsConcentration</code>\n</th>\n<td>Action requires <a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">concentration</a>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>IsDefaultWeaponAction</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>IsEnemySpell</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>IsHarmful</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>IsJump</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>IsLinkedSpellContainer</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>IsMelee</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>IsSpell</code>\n</th>\n<td>Action is a proper <a href=\"/wiki/Spell\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell\">spell</a> and everything that interacts with spells (e.g. <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Counterspell\" title=\"Counterspell\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Counterspell_Icon.webp/25px-Counterspell_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Counterspell_Icon.webp/38px-Counterspell_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Counterspell_Icon.webp/50px-Counterspell_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Counterspell\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Counterspell_Icon.webp/25px-Counterspell_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/50/Counterspell_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Counterspell\" title=\"Counterspell\">Counterspell</a>) will apply to this action.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>IsSwarmAttack</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>IsTrap</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>NoAOEDamageOnLand</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>NoCameraMove</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>NoCooldownOnMiss</code>\n</th>\n<td>This action does not go on cooldown if it misses.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>None</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>PickupEntityAndMove</code>\n</th>\n<td>This is used exclusively by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Improvised_Melee_Weapon\" title=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/25px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/38px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/50px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/25px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Improvised_Melee_Weapon\" title=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\">Improvised Melee Weapon</a> (and the Berserker variant). It determines if the the target object or creature can be picked up and moved.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>RangeIgnoreBlindness</code>\n</th>\n<td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blindness\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\">Blindness</a> does not reduce the range of this ability.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>RangeIgnoreSourceBounds</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>RangeIgnoreTargetBounds</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>RangeIgnoreVerticalThreshold</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>Stealth</code>\n</th>\n<td>Action can be performed without breaking <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hiding_(Condition)\" title=\"Hiding (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hiding\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hiding_(Condition)\" title=\"Hiding (Condition)\">Hiding</a>. See also <code>Invisible</code>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>TargetClosestEqualGroundSurface</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>Temporary</code>\n</th>\n<td>This action is temporarily granted and appears on the right-hand side of the hotbar in a special section.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>UnavailableInDialogs</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>UNUSED_D</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><code>Wildshape</code>\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"navbox-styles\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r138587\">.mw-parser-output .hlist dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul{margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .hlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul ul{display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt,.mw-parser-output .hlist li,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dd,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dt,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist li{margin:0;display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd:after,.mw-parser-output .hlist li:after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dd::after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist li::after{content:\" · \";font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd:last-child:after,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt:last-child:after,.mw-parser-output .hlist li:last-child:after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dd:last-child::after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dt:last-child::after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist li:last-child::after{content:none}.mw-parser-output .hlist dt:after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dt::after{content:\":\";font-weight:normal;font-size:100%}.mw-parser-output .hli